"One was a nightly read of the customer system. When that system was upgraded, the read broke, and retail's reports were wrong for two days: nobody upgrading it knew the read was there.":"Uno era una lectura nocturna del sistema de clientes. Al actualizarlo, la lectura se rompió, y los reportes de comercialización salieron mal dos días: nadie que lo actualizaba sabía que esa lectura existía.",
"So Yasmin asks for a rule: every flow goes through the integration platform, so nothing is hidden.":"Así que Yasmin pide una regla: que todo flujo pase por la plataforma de integración, para que nada quede oculto.",
